WEBVTT

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:10.990
<i>You know...</i>

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.120
<i>It's not like I'm a loner by nature.</i>

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:19.120
<i>But I would always find myself</i>

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.480
<i>spending more time alone than not.</i>

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:27.480
You said it!

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:28.380
I know!

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:29.630
Right?

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:33.130
Say, Uehara-san, have you 
been watching <i>BolChan?</i>

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:35.050
"Bolchan"?

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:37.220
Like, bouldering?!

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:40.670
Nah, <i>Bold Voltage Max Heart Channel.</i>

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:42.480
The one with Himepon.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:43.900
Y'know, this thing.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:47.710
<i>These may look like colorful burgers, 
but they're not.</i>

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:50.230
<i>They're sweets, and oh so sweet!</i>

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.230
No, never heard of it.

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:54.920
What? Seriously?!

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:58.090
You should totally watch! 
It's the new hot thing!

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:00.160
O-Okay.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:03.620
I love it! Himepon's, like, just the best!

00:01:04.770 --> 00:01:05.640
Let's go.

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:06.460
Yeah!

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:12.540
<i>To me...</i>

00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:31.380
<i>climbing is everything.</i>

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:54.630
<b><i>Iwakakeru!</i></b>

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:05.950
<b><i> Wall 7              Failure of a Climber</i></b>

00:03:02.630 --> 00:03:04.060
Whoa!

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:05.320
That girl's awesome!

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:09.370
More cheering. This is amazing.

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:12.380
Yeah. Konomi probably sent it.

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:14.110
Maybe even in one.

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:15.170
Right.

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:18.890
<i>If she's sent three semifinal problems,</i>

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:23.090
<i>Captain and I should be able 
to match or better her.</i>

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:25.100
<i>We can win!</i>

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:28.230
<i>Hanamiya can be champs!</i>

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:31.980
Go, go, Konomin!

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:37.100
Kasahara Konomi faces up to Problem D, 
the last one in the semis.

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:45.380
<i>I absolutely have to solve this problem.</i>

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:51.000
She's taking her time analyzing the 
problem while the others start climbing.

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:54.000
Will she send it in one again?

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:56.810
Master's incredible.

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:57.750
No.

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:01.020
This doesn't look good.

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:10.180
Oh, come on!

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:13.390
How is she so calm and composed?

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:15.650
It gets on my nerves!

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:22.120
<i>A flat wall with several large volumes.</i>

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:24.980
<i>It tests your balance and strength.</i>

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:33.870
<i>The foothold to the left of the 
zone hold will be hard to reach.</i>

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:41.130
<i>I could campus it.</i>

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:44.380
<i>The key is to grab the perfect 
part of the zone hold.</i>

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.670
<i>Okay, next is the crux.</i>

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:50.350
<i>i wAnt... tO PuSh...</i>

00:04:50.950 --> 00:04:53.310
<i>my right side into the wall to climb,</i>

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:56.310
<i>but I'll have to get into the corner snug</i>

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:58.680
<i>TO... dO... tHat...</i>

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:02.820
<i>The v0Lume's EdgE shoulD...</i>

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:05.700
What the...?

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:12.980
<i>That's weird. I can't fully analyze it.</i>

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:15.040
<i>What's come over me?</i>

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:19.170
Kasahara's taking even longer than usual.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.210
Will she have enough time to climb?

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:25.170
She takes her time analyzing 
the route before sending it in one.

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:28.090
That's Kasahara Konomi's climbing style.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:31.430
As long as she has the time to make 
one attempt, that should be enough for her.

00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:34.980
Whoa, there she goes!

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:38.010
<i>I took longer than I wanted to.</i>

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:40.190
<i>I'll have to hurry!</i>

00:05:40.510 --> 00:05:42.840
<i>Okay, the zone comes next.</i>

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:43.690
<i>I'll grab this hold,</i>

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:46.700
<i>and then push up with my right foot.</i>

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:55.910
She falls!

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:59.540
She slips now, of all times! A crying shame!

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:04.310
She couldn't send every semis problem in one.

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:06.730
Huh? Why?

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:08.980
And that's time up!

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:19.560
But she's still done incredibly well 
to send three out of four problems.

00:06:20.050 --> 00:06:23.590
Kasahara has made a real splash on the scene!

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:24.440
I could've done better...

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:27.070
Where'd that weird noise come from?

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.820
Why did I slip?

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:30.860
Nice, Konomin!

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.830
You're awesome, Master.

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:36.030
Three sends right off the bat?

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:38.590
Maybe I was taking her too lightly.

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:42.330
I thought I had her all figured 
out after feeling up her feet.

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:45.310
Now she just needs to build up 
strength and stamina.

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:48.590
If she does, sending everything 
in one won't be out of reach.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:00.990
<i>I hear applause, but not loud cheering.</i>

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:02.230
<i>She must've fallen.</i>

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:05.280
<i>Still, she ended up with three sends.</i>

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:06.980
<i>Way to go, Konomi!</i>

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:11.300
<i>A marvelous showing.</i>

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:14.870
<i>That makes things even more fun.</i>

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:20.650
<i>I can't wait to see how her results 
will warp the faces of everyone here.</i>

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:26.340
Yes, yes, yes, yes...

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:30.380
Whoa, another fall!

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:34.140
The stars of the prelims can 
barely climb these walls!

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:38.390
This is how difficult these problems are! 
This is how different the semis are!

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:42.140
<i>I thought this would be easy...</i>

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:45.360
<i>...but I can't even reach the 
zone holds, let alone finish!</i>

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:48.430
Nobody's finishing all of a sudden.

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:51.680
They're semifinal problems. 
This is how it usually goes.

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:54.110
They're doing what they can, 
but that's not enough.

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:58.060
But that Kasahara Konomi girl from 
Hanamiya was sending them with ease.

00:07:58.060 --> 00:08:00.320
Wasn't she so cool, Kurusu?

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:02.370
She cool Kuruised through it all.

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:07.380
<i>Kasahara Konomi made the crowd go 
crazy multiple times on these walls?</i>

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:09.380
<i>What is she, some kind of monster?!</i>

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:13.600
She's not that cute, though.

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:14.380
You think?

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:15.210
What?

00:08:15.210 --> 00:08:16.650
Y-You're right.

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:17.890
Make yourself clear.

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:20.780
...ng... ong...

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:21.890
That's wrong.

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:32.000
No, don't toe hook that.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.780
With your reach, you should...

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:37.840
<i>And now the crowd's fallen silent.</i>

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:38.950
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:43.460
<i>Are the walls easy or hard? Which is it?</i>

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:46.460
<i>If she could climb these,</i>

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:49.620
<i>there is no way I can't.</i>

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:51.960
<i>I'll finish this time, for sure.</i>

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.460
Ooba falls.

00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:08.690
Ooba's crashed face-first into 
the semifinal wall... No.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:11.280
Into the wall called Kasahara Konomi!

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:16.780
And it's not only her. Everyone in 
these semis has pride in themselves,

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:23.170
but they can't unhear the cheers for Kasahara, 
who squeaked in at 20th place.

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:25.120
"If #20 could one-shot these,"

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:27.530
"of course I can, too!"

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:29.280
But they <i>can't,</i>

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:30.660
and that makes them panic.

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:32.890
<i>This time...</i>

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:34.880
<i>I have to do it this time!</i>

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:38.890
They panic and make mistakes, 
and the more mistakes they make...

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:50.150
<i>This is nothing!</i>

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:52.660
And time's up!

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:56.280
Ooba fails to finish yet again.

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:01.950
She hasn't sent any of the 
three problems so far.

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:03.690
<i>Why?</i>

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:08.460
<i>How could you one-shot these walls 
when you're new to the sport?</i>

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:12.710
<i>Seriously, what is your deal?</i>

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:14.960
<i>Why are you like this?!</i>

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:19.970
Next up, we have Ooba on Problem D,

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:23.580
and Uehara from Hanamiya Girls' 
attempting Problem A.

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:26.310
Again, that crux needs...

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:28.440
Jun-chan!

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:32.940
<i>I was in good form during the prelims.</i>

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:37.640
<i>I'm going to keep that up,
 follow Konomi's lead,</i>

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:40.220
<i>and one-shot this!</i>

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.690
<i>The final problem...</i>

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:50.420
<i>This is it! Understand?</i>

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:29.000
No, wrong.

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:31.400
It's a tough combination.

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:33.380
You have to make sure you don't swing off.

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:37.300
Uehara falls.

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:39.630
<i>What's with this crux?</i>

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:41.660
<i>I have to jump to reach it,</i>

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:43.340
<i>but if I jump too far I swing right off.</i>

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:45.980
<i>Konomi sent this?</i>

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:47.720
<i>In one?</i>

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:56.950
No... I can't just let that happen.

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:19.900
Wow, Ooba suddenly let out a massive scream.

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:21.500
What could be the matter?

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:24.140
<i>I get it.</i>

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:26.420
<i>I hate to admit it, but I have to.</i>

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:30.520
<i>Kasahara Konomi's currently 
in a different league than me.</i>

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:37.520
<i>What matters now is accepting it and 
contributing what I can to Caterno's bid.</i>

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:41.780
<i>If I can't finish,
 I have to go for the sure points.</i>

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:43.280
<i>That's the focus!</i>

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:45.530
Ooba secures the zone hold!

00:12:46.500 --> 00:12:48.780
<i>This is really as far as I can go.</i>

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:51.280
Huh? She falls?

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:54.290
What happened? She seems to have given up.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:59.930
That scream of hers was 
a resigned war cry, huh?

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:04.140
Or should I call it a fall cry?

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:07.020
She may have been sending 
a message to her teammates.

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:11.550
<i>I got the zone. That's enough for now.</i>

00:13:11.550 --> 00:13:13.690
<i>I'll leave the rest to Captain and Rina-san.</i>

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:17.020
<i>Kasahara-san...</i>

00:13:18.070 --> 00:13:20.520
<i>Things won't go this way next time!</i>

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:29.030
Huh? Jun-chan?

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:31.190
And that's time up.

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:36.040
Uehara couldn't clear or 
secure the zone in Problem A.

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:44.000
How?

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:49.050
Jun-chan! You can do it next time!

00:13:50.320 --> 00:13:53.180
It's time for Uehara to attempt Problem B.

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:09.870
Damn it!

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:16.040
She falls!

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.610
She falls again!

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:24.100
It's Uehara's turn to attempt Problem C.

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:26.630
Hang in there! You can do it!

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:38.780
What? Another fall?

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:47.900
Uehara has to attempt Problem D 
when it's all going wrong for her.

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:57.920
She falls!

00:14:57.920 --> 00:15:02.420
What could be the problem? She's lacking 
the edge she showed in the prelims.

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:31.490
Uehara-san.

00:15:31.870 --> 00:15:34.440
What're you doing? It looks fun!

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:36.240
Kikuchi?

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:39.450
I'm training my grip strength.

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:41.040
During break?

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:44.250
Oh, are you on a sports team or something?

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:47.240
Not at school, no.

00:15:47.240 --> 00:15:48.020
But...

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:52.340
I do bouldering.

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:55.400
Bol... Bold?

00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:58.740
Not <i>Bold Voltage 
Max Heart Channel,</i> okay?!

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:03.270
Bouldering. It's a sport 
where you climb walls.

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:05.940
What? That sounds fun!

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:12.080
Say, Uehara-san...
 Wait, can I call you Jun-chan?

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:14.000
S-Sure.

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:16.320
And you can call me Haruna.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:23.460
<i>Today on </i>Max Heart<i>, 
we've got warabimochi!</i>

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:26.960
<b>Warabimochi</b>

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:26.960
<i>Have you ever tried 
authentic warabimochi?</i>

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:29.920
<i>Bzzt!</i>

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:32.900
<i>I don't mean the ones they sell 
in convenience stores.</i>

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:36.430
Jun-chan!

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:38.430
Can I eat with you?

00:16:38.840 --> 00:16:41.310
Y-Yeah.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.640
I watched <i>BolChan.</i>

00:16:44.640 --> 00:16:47.020
Seriously? How'd you like it?

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:50.540
I didn't get what's so good about it.

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:53.090
I like the brutal honesty.

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:57.680
Honestly, I don't find it very good, either.

00:16:57.680 --> 00:16:59.390
Then... why?

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:04.080
Well, I've gotta hold up 
my end of the conversation.

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:07.610
I don't agree with that, Haruna.

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:09.120
If it's boring,

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:12.300
forcing yourself to watch it so you 
can talk about it is pointless.

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:14.840
You're so serious about everything.

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:18.410
Anyway, I went and watched 
a video on bouldering!

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:21.600
It was crazy! And you do that?

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:23.470
Yeah.

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:26.430
I want to see you climbing.

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:28.560
Can I come watch you compete?

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:33.230
I can't compete just yet, 
but I do practice every day.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:37.740
You can come watch me at the gym anytime.

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:40.740
Hang in there, Jun-chan!

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:51.240
You were amazing! 
It made me wanna try!

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:56.380
Do you think I can? I wanna climb!

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:01.510
Wow, this is kinda hard.

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:03.920
Whoa.

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:06.020
This is cool!

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:09.950
That was so much fun!

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:11.770
Can I come again?

00:18:12.160 --> 00:18:14.540
We should climb together sometime.

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:18.150
What's wrong?

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:21.640
Bouldering's not just a game for me.

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:24.860
You don't have to force yourself to join me.

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:32.540
It's not a sport you can 
just pick up on a whim.

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:37.050
Do you want to take it up seriously?

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:42.560
Aren't you just going along with what 
I like, like you do with <i>BolChan?</i>

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:43.560
Jun-chan...

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:45.810
If that's how you feel, then don't bother!

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:52.810
I didn't mean to...

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:05.490
You don't have to patronize me.

00:19:06.130 --> 00:19:09.350
Just find something that you enjoy.

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:12.880
And when you do, take it seriously.

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:20.440
<i>To me...</i>

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:32.120
<i>Climbing is my life.</i>

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:38.400
<i>Anytime, anywhere,</i>

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:41.400
<i>climbing's been the only thing on my mind.</i>

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:44.120
<i>It's my everything.</i>

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:47.660
<i>I've never cared about anything else.</i>

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:50.910
<i>All I've done is climb.</i>

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:55.170
<i>Nothing else matters.</i>

00:19:56.310 --> 00:20:00.180
<i>Climbing is all I have!</i>

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:05.800
<i>Why?</i>

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:09.400
<i>Why is this happening?</i>

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:13.220
Uehara falls!

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:17.800
She does still have time, 
but this next attempt will be her last.

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:23.610
Oh? What's this?

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:26.070
Uehara's not moving!

00:20:27.090 --> 00:20:28.280
<i>I can't.</i>

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:30.910
<i>My body's just fine,</i>

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:34.170
<i>but my mind's frozen.</i>

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:38.460
And that's time!

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:42.760
I didn't expect Uehara to not send 
a single problem in these semis!

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:46.330
No... Jun-chan...

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:55.020
Jun-chan.

00:20:56.130 --> 00:20:57.190
Welcome back.

00:20:59.790 --> 00:21:02.570
I bought some drinks. Want one?

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:04.950
Or do you wanna cool down first?

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:11.040
Sorry, not right now.

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:13.560
Jun...

00:21:21.110 --> 00:21:22.990
<i>That last attempt...</i>

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:27.000
<i>I could've still climbed, but I didn't.</i>

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:32.940
<i>I was so afraid of falling again,
 my heart straight-up rejected the wall.</i>

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:48.680
<i>A climber too scared to climb could never 
produce the kind of results they want.</i>

00:21:50.760 --> 00:21:54.730
<i>I'm a total failure of a climber!</i>

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:00.310
Don't cry.

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:02.620
You'll be fine!

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:39.890
<b><i>Iwakakeru!</i></b>

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:39.890
<b><i>Wall 8: Tears of Disappointment</i></b>
